1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,320
Thanks for coming in. Where would you like to start today?

2
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:12,240
I wanted to talk about sleep. I have been waking around three most nights
and then the worrying starts.

3
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:19,560
Tell me about the worrying. Is it the same thread each night, or does it move around?

4
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:29,880
It moves. Some nights it is work, some nights it is money, last night it was
my sister and whether I should have called her back.

5
00:01:30,400 --> 00:01:38,220
That sounds exhausting. Let us look at what happens in the twenty minutes
before you go up to bed.
